[ \partial_t \rho + \nabla \cdot (\rho \mathbf{v}) = 0 ]

[ \partial_t(\rho \mathbf{v}) + \nabla \cdot (\rho \mathbf{v}\mathbf{v}) = -\nabla p + \nabla \cdot \mathbf{\tau} + \rho \mathbf{g} ]

Stress tensor:

[ \tau_{ij} = \mu\left(\partial_i v_j + \partial_j v_i\right) - \frac{2}{3}\mu(\nabla \cdot \mathbf{v})\delta_{ij} ]

Equation of state (ideal astrophysical gas):

[ p = (\gamma - 1)\rho e ]

